### Feature Users — CREATE
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### LOGIN como admin (ejecutar PRIMERO: guarda el token en @token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### CREATE -> 201 (cajero del turno de la tarde). El `password` se guarda hasheado.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Jaider",
  "email": "Jaider@tazanorte.local",
  "password": "23456789",
  "avatar": null
}

### 409 — username ya en uso
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "email": "otro.admin@tazanorte.local",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 400 — contraseña de menos de 8 caracteres
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "barista.noche",
  "email": "barista.noche@tazanorte.local",
  "password": "123"
}
